    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_atlantic_body",
      "x": 340,
      "y": 110,
      "width": 268,
      "height": 276,
      "text": "1.  Sierra → CASM compilation\n    compute program_hash\n\n2.  Cairo VM execution\n    → execution trace\n    → public output\n    (assert fail = no proof)\n\n3.  Stone Prover\n    trace → STARK proof\n\n4.  Starknet L2 verification\n    split-calldata  (n txs)\n    tx 1: verify_proof_initial\n    tx 2..n-1: verify_proof_step\n    tx n: verify_proof_final\n    (n depends on proof size)\n\n5.  Fact registration\n    fact_hash = H(metadata_hash,\n      H(metadata_output))\n    → written to FactRegistry",
      "originalText": "1.  Sierra → CASM compilation\n    compute program_hash\n\n2.  Cairo VM execution\n    → execution trace\n    → public output\n    (assert fail = no proof)\n\n3.  Stone Prover\n    trace → STARK proof\n\n4.  Starknet L2 verification\n    split-calldata  (n txs)\n    tx 1: verify_proof_initial\n    tx 2..n-1: verify_proof_step\n    tx n: verify_proof_final\n    (n depends on proof size)\n\n5.  Fact registration\n    fact_hash = H(metadata_hash,\n      H(metadata_output))\n    → written to FactRegistry",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900027,
